# 5. PM2 Process Management Issues

## Problem

The Node.js application stopped running after terminal sessions closed.

## Cause

The app was started in the foreground.

## Solution

Installed PM2 and started the app as a background process:

```bash
sudo npm install pm2 -g
pm2 start app.js
```

## What I Learned

* Importance of process managers
* Background process handling
* Application persistence

