# 6. MongoDB Ubuntu 24.04 Compatibility Issues

## Problem

MongoDB installation issues occurred on Ubuntu 24.04.

## Cause

MongoDB 7.x repositories were originally designed for Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy).

## Solution

Used the Jammy repository manually for compatibility:

```bash
https://repo.mongodb.org/apt/ubuntu jammy/mongodb-org/7.0 multiverse
```

## What I Learned

* Linux package repository compatibility
* Dependency management
* OS version considerations

