# 7. Environment Variable Configuration

## Problem

The application could not connect to the database after instance recreation.

## Cause

The database IP address changed after rebuilding infrastructure from AMIs.

## Solution

Updated environment variable:

```bash
export DB_HOST=mongodb://<DB_PRIVATE_IP>:27017/posts
```

Restarted the application using PM2.

## What I Learned

* Dynamic infrastructure considerations
* Importance of environment variables
* Infrastructure decoupling

